# slimevr-imu-log v1
# sensor LSM6DSV
# acc_ts 0.008319467
# gyr_ts 0.0041597337
# acc_scale 0.0011964112
# gyr_scale 6.1086525E-4
# note raw uncalibrated counts; apply *_scale to convert
#
# Test fixture, not a corpus recording -- it has no .meta and belongs to no
# wearer. Ten seconds of a real LSM6DSV on a WEMOS D1 Mini, sitting still on a
# desk, captured over WiFi by `record-corpus`.
#
# It exists to be the negative control for issue #41: a contact detector run
# over this must find nothing. Synthetic noise would not do, because the
# question is whether a real device's floor -- quantisation, mounting, whatever
# the desk is doing -- stays below a threshold set from that same floor.
